id: pm-slack-fitn
title: Read Slack digests through the complete SDK corpus and refuse unreadable records
description: The fixed digest directory list omits configured item types such as Chore and its scalar parser silently skips malformed or unreadable records. Replace the package-owned parser with the public listAllComplete SDK operation. Supersedes the implementation approach in pm-slack-06ti while preserving formatting and aggregation semantics.
type: Issue
status: blocked
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-29T17:22:22.309Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-29T17:39:10.459Z"
author: codex-slack-digest-0929
acceptance_criteria: Configured custom item directories and escaped titles appear in digests; Unreadable or malformed source records fail before any webhook request; Complete SDK reads include terminal items and refuse truncation or omissions; Real installed CLI and packed Node/Bun acceptance preserve dry-run and digest behavior; All mandatory source coverage and documentation gates and exact-head reviews pass before merge
risk: medium
blocked_reason: Implementation validated locally and in packed consumers; release awaits pm-slack-5fb5 all-source quality gates and exact-head review completion
